@managerToken = <PEGAR_AQUI_TOKEN_MANAGER>

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. CREACIÓN DE HABITACIONES (Solo OWNER o MANAGER)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 1A. OWNER crea una habitación SINGLE (Debe funcionar 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "101",
  "type": "SINGLE"
}

### 1B. MANAGER crea una habitación DOUBLE (Debe funcionar 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "102A",
  "type": "DOUBLE"
}

### 1C. Intentar crear una habitación con tipo inválido (Debe fallar 400 - Validación Zod/Class-validator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "103",
  "type": "PRESIDENTIAL"
}

### 1D. Intentar crear una habitación duplicada (Debe fallar 409 - Conflicto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "101",
  "type": "SUITE"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. OBTENER LISTA DE HABITACIONES (Cualquier rol)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 2A. Obtener todas las habitaciones (Debe retornar array de cuartos con status AVAILABLE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ACTUALIZAR ESTADO DE HABITACIÓN — PATCH /rooms/:id/status
### Reemplaza el :id con el ID real de una habitación existente
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 3A. Cambiar habitación a OCCUPIED (simula Check-in directo) — Debe retornar 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OCCUPIED"
}

### 3B. Cambiar habitación a CLEANING (simula Check-out) — Debe retornar 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CLEANING"
}

### 3C. Liberar habitación a AVAILABLE (simula fin de limpieza) — Debe retornar 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 3D. Mandar habitación a MAINTENANCE — Debe retornar 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

### 3E. Enviar estado inválido — Debe fallar 400 (validación del DTO)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PRESIDENCIAL"
}

### 3F. ID de habitación inexistente — Debe fallar 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rooms/9999/status
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}
